{title: MR. BOJANGLES (In C)}
{subtitle: Nitty Gritty Dirt Band}
     Base notes - From the (Am) hold fast with your middle and index but bring your ring finger up to the 6th string/3rd fret and pick <g>, then lift up the ring finger and pick the open 5th string note <a>, then drop the ring finger down onto the 5th string and pick the now covered 5th string/3rd fret note <c>, and strum (C) to begin the song on "knew".

     Treble notes - From the (Am) lift off your ring finger to open the 3rd string and pick <g>, replace your ring finger to form (Am) and pick the covered 3rd string note <a>, and then pick the already covered 2nd string note <c>, and strum (C) to begin the song on "knew."

